Show drafts scheduled to send later that have not gone out yet, soonest first. Review first, then schedule with `mxr send <draft-id> --expected-revision <revision> --expected-workspace '<owner-json>' --at <TIME>`; cancel with `mxr unsend <draft-id>`

Usage: mxr drafts scheduled

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
